- `warehouse._flock` documents that the OS releases the lock when the holder dies. It opens the lock file with `O_CREAT` under `home_dir()`.
- `dashboard.__main__.spawn` sends all three streams to `DEVNULL` and uses `start_new_session=True` and `close_fds=True`. That is the detach milestone 7 copies.
